=== Aegis Phase 1: Real Hardware Boot (ASUS TP201S) ===
Captured: physical screen (GOP console) via photo/video, transcribed by hand.
Boot medium: SanDisk Cruzer Blade (7.5G) UEFI GPT ESP, kernel df7f038 (AHCI driver).
This is the first-ever Aegis boot on real silicon.

