The loader handed off successfully. The kernel's own boot log (frame
allocator, PCI scan, AHCI probe, probe battery) follows on the screen;
not yet captured. Note: ~1.8 GB conventional RAM is available, so the
QEMU-only 61 MiB frame-allocator limitation does not apply on this
hardware.
